WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.138
Day five.

00:00:01.138 --> 00:00:03.007
You're almost through your first week.

00:00:03.007 --> 00:00:04.946
Your shift is about to end when Maya

00:00:04.946 --> 00:00:06.989
lets you know that someone called out.

00:00:06.989 --> 00:00:09.195
She asks if you can stay two more hours.

00:00:09.195 --> 00:00:10.832
The extra money would help.

00:00:10.832 --> 00:00:12.295
But you're tired, and you

00:00:12.295 --> 00:00:14.234
already made plans for tonight.

00:00:14.234 --> 00:00:16.103
Saying yes can have benefits.

00:00:16.103 --> 00:00:19.517
Saying no does not automatically make you unreliable.

00:00:19.517 --> 00:00:22.384
Think about what you can realistically commit to.
